</p></span></div><div data-rid="4da8f4dd-3e88-4826-bfcc-4117bc80bb61" class="r-zwhey8"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1od2ay1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rnfmptue32:" aria-controls="replo-:Rnfmptue32:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="1c6768ba-2f75-4213-87c0-c1a158c4ff81" class="r-1yhf21n"><div data-rid="5b2113cc-7659-4c53-be1e-ad62d162e9fc" class="r-1bsn99 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)">Most women notice an energy boost from Monthlies within days, then experience fewer and less intense cramps, less bloating, more stable moods, and better sleep during their second cycle after starting. Some feel these changes sooner, others might take a bit longer – as every woman’s cycle is unique.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)">That’s why we encourage you to try it yourself. If you don’t feel more energized and in control, with less bloating and pain, you have 90 days to claim a full refund of your first order. To be eligible, you’ll need to have tried Monthlies for 90 days (i.e. purchased three consecutive monthly subscriptions). Simply email us at </span><a href="mailto:returns@withmonthlies.com"><span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)">returns@withmonthlies.com</span></a><span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)"> without giving any further reason.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5ab8e9d2-9dfa-4366-b021-e97f5b6f5ade" class="r-1y1fb1v" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="279f60e3-dd50-4838-b99b-6f58f5cdc2e5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rrfmptue32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-djz